    "result_text": "The test passes. Let me summarize the full-stack change I implemented.\n\n## Done \u2014 the test passes \u2713\n\nI added a **task list per project**, ticking tasks OPEN \u2194 DONE, as an additive full-stack change.\n\n**Database** (`src/main/resources/db/migration/V14__tasks.sql`)\n- New `task` table: `id` (IDENTITY, `GENERATED BY DEFAULT` so seeds can supply explicit ids), `project_id` FK \u2192 `project`, `title`, `done BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE`.\n\n**Server** (OfficeFloor REST + Spring beans)\n- `Task` entity, `TaskRepository` (`findAllByOrderByIdAsc`), `NewTask`/`ToggleTask` request bodies.\n- `GET /api/tasks` (`TasksGet`) \u2014 lists all tasks; `tasks.GET.yml`.\n- `POST /api/tasks` (`TasksPost`) \u2014 adds a task to a project, audits `TASK_CREATED \u2026`; `tasks.POST.yml`.\n- `POST /api/tasks/toggle` (`TaskToggle`) \u2014 flips `done`, audits `TASK_TOGGLED id=\u2026 done=\u2026`; `tasks/toggle.POST.yml` (under `/api/` so it isn't swallowed by the SPA fallback).\n- Extended the harness seed support: `reset` now truncates `task`, and `seed` inserts a `tasks` fixture array (matching the spec's `{ id, projectId, title, done }`).\n\n**Front-end** (additive new files only)\n- `features/projects/ProjectTasksPanel.tsx` \u2014 queries `['tasks']`, filters to the project it's handed, renders `project-tasks-table` with `task-row-<id>` / `task-title` / `task-status` (`OPEN`/`DONE`), a `task-toggle-<id>` button, plus an add-task form. Toggle/add are `useMutation` + `invalidateQueries(['tasks'])` \u2014 no server data copied into state.\n- `features/projects/tasks.slot.tsx` \u2014 fills the existing `ProjectDetail` slot (auto-discovered), so the project-detail route was not edited.\n\nAll `data-testid` anchors match the spec exactly, and no pinned scaffolding or the test spec was touched.",
